https://www.dds.iub.edu/?genre=article\&sid=ProQ:\&atitle=Personality+profiles+and+minor+affective+psychopathology+in+a+non-clinical+sample\%3A+An+empirical+verification+of+Cloninger\%27s+theoretical+model.\&title=Journal+of+Affective+Disorders\&issn=0165-0327\&date=2009-12-01\&volume=119\&issue=1-3\&spage=34\&aulast=Gurpegui\%2C+Manuel\%3BJurado\%2C+Dolores\%3BFern\%C3\%A1ndez-Molina\%2C+M.+Carmen\%3BMoreno-Abril\%2C+Obdulia\%3BLuna\%2C+Juan+D.\%3BAlarc\%C3\%B3n\%2C+Renato+D.},
